				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="30" inout="out" _len="2050" _ulen="1438" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
OTC_FUND_ISCD^OTC펀드종목코드^12^0^0^0^0^0^0
INVT_AMT^투자금액^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
PBLC_DATE^발행일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
